    ('at-the-cafe', 'Chapter 2 · Dining', 'Lesson 14 · At the Café', 14, 'dialogue', '示范对话', 2, 'dialogue', 104, 'Daniel', NULL, 'Yes, I''d also like an espresso and a brownie, please.', '是的，我还想要一杯浓缩咖啡和一块布朗尼。', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'espresso, brownie', 1),
